==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|brauð|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|braudą|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/prøyːð/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|øyːð|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|brauðs|brauð}}

# {{uncountable|lang=is}} [[bread]]
# a [[loaf]] of bread
# a [[living]]
# the [[office]] of [[parson]] or [[vicar]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-n-s|br|au|ð}}

====Synonyms====
